@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - ATM Withdrawal

[*] --> Idle : Card Inserted

state Idle {
    state SelectAmount
}

SelectAmount : entry / display predefined amounts
SelectAmount : do / allow user to select amount or enter custom amount
SelectAmount --> Withdrawing : Amount Selected
SelectAmount --> CancelTransaction : User selects cancel

Withdrawing : entry / initiate withdrawal process
Withdrawing : do / check account balance and availability
Withdrawing --> Dispensing : Sufficient Funds Available
Withdrawing --> CancelTransaction : Insufficient Funds Available

Dispensing : entry / dispense cash
Dispensing : do / update account balance
Dispensing --> Idle : Cash dispensed successfully

CancelTransaction : entry / stop transaction
CancelTransaction : do / return card
CancelTransaction --> Idle : Transaction cancelled

Idle --> [*]
@enduml
